Maximum port for reverse forwards.
@opt **--dns-server** *ip*
@cli spell: --dns-server <ip>
@cli help: IPv4 resolver for outbound opens, and the resolver
@cli help: handed to packet-mode clients. Required by
@cli help: --packet-egress tun; no default

IPv4 resolver for server-side outbound opens. It is also the resolver handed to
