@cli spell: --packet-egress tun
@cli help: Enable packet_bulk_v1 over an operator-
@cli help: prepared Linux TUN/NAT interface.

Enable packet-native egress over an operator-prepared Linux TUN/NAT interface.
Disabled by default. The source-tree helper **tools/yume_packet_quick.py** can
